  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnerships&apos; Team Peoples Postcode Lottery (PPL) Allocation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">.  Establish decolonial partnerships with Strategic Priority Countries .  Learn and co -create new ways of partnering through reflexive listening .  Publishing and socialising the Racial Justice Framework and the Decolonial Partnership Strategy .  Strengthening Oxfam Great Britain&apos;s (OGB&apos;s) Partnerships Team&apos;s decolonial technical support to countries .  Building an accountability mechanism and database .  External influencing on OGB&apos;s Racial Justice and Decolonial Partnerships strategies</narrative>
  </description>
